        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ŋuɔ̱t kɛ kui̱ yäcä mi lät mänɛ",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 30:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Muthɛ bööth thuk duëli ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl jiök i̱, “Nɛmɛ ɛ jɛn min laar Kuoth Nhial ɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.30.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.30.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 30:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mi wä raan rɔ yac kɛ mi bɛ ka̱m Kuoth Nhial, kiɛ cɛ guk la̱t, a jɛ /ci ruacdɛ nyɔk. A jɛ lät tin diaal tin cɛ lar i̱ bɛ la̱t. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.30.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.30.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 30:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiɛ mi wä ciek rɔ ya̱c Kuoth Nhial kɛ mi bɛ ka̱m jɛ, kä ŋotdɛ dhɔr gua̱n, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.30.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.30.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 30:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kä ci gua̱n ya̱cdɛ liŋ kɛnɛ min cɛ lar i̱ bɛ thöp, kä thilɛ mi ci gua̱n ɛ la̱r jɛ. Bi ya̱cdɛ te thi̱n, kä bi tin diaal tin cɛ lar te thi̱n. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.30.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.30.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 30:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mi wä gua̱n ɛ wä gak kɛ jɛn cäŋ in yaacɛ ni rɔ, /ci ya̱cdɛ, kɛnɛ min cɛ lar i̱ bɛ thöp bi te thi̱n. Kä bi Kuoth Nhial jɛ päl ikä, kɛ ɣöö ci gua̱n ɛ gak. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.30.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.30.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 30:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mi ca kuɛn ɛ wut kɛ kɔr kä min cɛ ya̱c la̱t, kä cɛ duɔ̱ɔ̱r lar a /kenɛ jɛ car. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.30.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.30.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 30:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ci cɔwdɛ jɛ liŋ, kä thilɛ mi cɛ la̱r jɛ kɛ cäŋ ëë liŋɛ ni jɛ. Inɔ bi ya̱cdɛ te thi̱n, kä bi min cɛ lar te thi̱n. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.30.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.30.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 30:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mi ci cɔwdɛ jɛ gak kɛ cäŋ ëë liŋɛ ni jɛ, bɛ ya̱cdɛ min tekɛ jɛ päl /kenɛ jɛ car a gɔaa ɛn min cɛ lar kɛ lɛpdɛ. Kä bi Kuoth Nhial ɛ pälikä. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.30.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.30.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 30:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Duundɛ ɣöö ya̱c ciek jɔkä kɛnɛ ciek mi ci da̱k, bi tin diaal tin cɛ lar te cuŋä kä jɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.30.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.30.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 30:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mi yaacɛ rɔ dhɔr cɔadɛ kiɛ cɛ rɔ yac kɛ duɔ̱ɔ̱r, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.30.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.30.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 30:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kä ci cɔwdɛ jɛ liŋ, kä thilɛ mi cɛ la̱r jɛ kä /kenɛ jɛ gak. Inɔ bi ya̱cdɛ te thi̱n, kä bi tin diaal tin cɛ lar te thi̱n. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.30.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.30.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 30:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mi ci cɔwdɛ jɛ gak kɛ cäŋ ëë liŋɛ ni jɛ, kɛn tin diaal tëë cɛ yac ni rɔ kä cɛ lar i̱ bɛ thöp, /cikɛ bi te thi̱n. Ci cɔwdɛ kɛ gak, kä bi Kuoth Nhial ɛ pälikä. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.30.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.30.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 30:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ya̱c mi ci ciek ɛ la̱t kɛnɛ mi cɛ lar kɛ yac, dëë cɔwdɛ jɛ jak kä thuɔ̱k, kä derɛ jɛ jak kä thil. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.30.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.30.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 30:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mi thilɛ mi ci cɔwdɛ jɛ lar ɛn cäŋ ɛmɔ, luɔtdɛ ɣöö ci cɔwdɛ tin diaal tin cɛ lat nhɔk. Kɛ ɣöö thilɛ mi cɛ la̱r jɛ kɛ cäŋ ëë liŋɛ ni kɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.30.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.30.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 30:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä duundɛ ɣöö mi wee kɛ wä gak kɛ kɔr kä min cɛ liŋ, bi riɛkdɛ tekɛ jɛ.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.30.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.30.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 30:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.30.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.30.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 30:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä ti̱ti̱ kɛ kɛn ŋuɔ̱t tëë ci Kuoth Nhial kɛ la̱r Muthɛ kɛ kam wutdä kɛnɛ ciekdɛ, kɛ kam wutdä kɛnɛ nyaadɛ, min ŋotdɛ ɛ nyal dhɔr gua̱n.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.30.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.30.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
